{"id":"bc8a56742e504316","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse.md","title":"Horn与Krom的存在前缀坍缩","display":"thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse — Horn与Krom的存在前缀坍缩","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse","aliases":["29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse"],"display":"thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse — Horn与Krom的存在前缀坍缩","depends_on":["[[29-df-so-horn]]","[[29-df-so-krom]]","[[29-df-so-so-exists]]","[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Lemma 9.28; Claims 9.29–9.30; Exercise 9.31, pp.153–154, DjVu scans 168–169","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页168–169图像；陈述及证明框架已对照，练习中的辅助断言未独立重证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse — Horn与Krom的存在前缀坍缩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd3691bd016b708d\" href=\"?note=dd3691bd016b708d\" title=\"29-df-so-horn\">29-df-so-horn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d766986df2163a0\" href=\"?note=8d766986df2163a0\" title=\"29-df-so-krom\">29-df-so-krom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 9.28; Claims 9.29–9.30; Exercise 9.31, pp.153–154, DjVu scans 168–169"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页168–169图像；陈述及证明框架已对照，练习中的辅助断言未独立重证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是允许任意二阶量词前缀的受限句子集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\">\\(\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a> 的存在二阶句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 沿用本目录的有限非空结构论域；此处只断言原书结果在该论域的实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau],\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]\\}\\;\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau],\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]\\}\\;\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 9.28，印刷页153–154、扫描页168–169。原书陈述覆盖有限和无限结构；本原子保留目录既有的有限非空语义，未把仅对有限结构定义的满足接口冒充无限结构语义。书中先消去形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\exists\\bar Q\">\\(\\forall P\\exists\\bar Q\\)</span> 的前缀：Horn 使用对少量缺失元组的测试与见证交，Krom 使用文字蕴含路径条件。Claims 9.29、9.30 的证明留在 Exercise 9.31，本次只核对其在坍缩论证中的作用，未声称已完成该练习或任何机器证明。语法片段本身仍允许任意前缀；结论是存在一个等价的存在前缀句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-so-horn","status":"resolved","id":"dd3691bd016b708d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-horn]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-krom","status":"resolved","id":"8d766986df2163a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-krom]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-so-exists","status":"resolved","id":"dd316f316437dd24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-so-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-so-exists","status":"resolved","id":"dd316f316437dd24","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]$ 是 [[29-df-so-so-exists]] 的存在二阶句子集；$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 见 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]$ 是 [[29-df-so-so-exists]] 的存在二阶句子集；$\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}$ 见 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau],\\mathrm{SO(Krom)}[\\tau]\\}\\;\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[\\tau]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\psi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\exists\\bar Q","display":false}],"bytes":2106,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse]] — Horn/Krom 的存在前缀坍缩"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-so-horn-krom-existential-collapse]]"}],"outgoing":["dd3691bd016b708d","8d766986df2163a0","dd316f316437dd24","8372f1f6b9135d87","4de8e0c8085801f5"]}